# ADVANCED / OPTIONAL — most people never need this file.
#
# By default, the backend serves this frontend's build directly from the same
# port (see backend/src/server.ts and setup.bat), so the app just works at
# http://localhost:4000 with zero configuration.
#
# Only set VITE_API_BASE_URL if you're deliberately running the frontend build
# on a different machine or port than the backend (e.g. a custom reverse-proxy
# setup). If that's not your situation, leave this file untouched/absent.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://192.168.1.50:4000/api
